WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.481
When you finish, choose Log out and confirm.

00:00:03.531 --> 00:00:08.854
Your everyday routine is simple: check new submissions, record your follow-up,

00:00:08.904 --> 00:00:13.263
and keep content changes in draft until you have previewed them.

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:16.570
Publish only when you are happy with the result.
